Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.47,0:01:00.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're late, Kitty. Kirito.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.47,0:01:03.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who's there?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.83,0:01:05.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've been out here so long.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.77,0:01:06.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I might catch cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.77,0:01:10.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sugo!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.75,0:01:12.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You did a very bad thing, Kirito.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.59,0:01:15.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, I can still feel the pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.23,0:01:17.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's over, Sugo.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.73,0:01:19.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You better turn yourself in.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.79,0:01:20.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.49,0:01:23.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Finished?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.40,0:01:24.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hardly.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.32,0:01:27.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are lots of companies that\Nwould kill to have me in my research.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.09,0:01:33.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And once it's complete there won't be\Nanything or anyone standing in my way,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.19,0:01:35.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then I'll be the god of this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.47,0:01:38.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh But first first I'm going to kill you
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.41,0:01:48.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on get up I said get up
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.05,0:01:58.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think a piece of trash\Nlike you can get in my way?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.27,0:02:00.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you think I'd let you slow me down?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.77,0:02:03.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wanna know what the punishment is?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.11,0:02:04.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Death.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.23,0:02:08.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't accept anything less.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.03,0:02:15.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.21,0:02:17.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My right eye's all foggy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.89,0:02:20.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I won't miss again, promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.59,0:02:28.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.65,0:02:30.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You little boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.47,0:02:32.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a piece of scum!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.43,0:02:34.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't have any real power!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.99,0:02:39.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And neither do you, Sugo.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.03,0:02:43.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I damn you!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.91,0:02:48.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.63,0:02:55.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Such a weak weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.79,0:02:56.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Too light.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.19,0:02:58.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No reach.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.47,0:03:02.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And it's all I'm gonna need\Nto kill you once and for all.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.89,0:03:19.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Non it don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.91,0:03:22.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Non it don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.17,0:03:27.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Non it don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.83,0:03:32.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Non!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.45,0:04:12.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry up, she's waiting for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.23,0:04:40.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Asuna.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.93,0:04:44.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kirito.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.05,0:05:00.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's okay now. It's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.03,0:05:05.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I fought the final boss just\Nnow, and the last battle's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.15,0:05:07.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's all over.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.25,0:05:14.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, but I can't\Nhear too well right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.33,0:05:17.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think I know what you said, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.89,0:05:18.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What you meant.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.71,0:05:21.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That it's really over.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.77,0:05:27.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And finally, finally, I get to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.53,0:05:36.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So anyway, I'm Asuna, Asuna Yuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.69,0:05:38.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I'm finally back.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.81,0:05:43.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm Kazuto Kirigaya.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.91,0:05:46.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Welcome home, Asuna.
