Dialogue: 1,0:08:02.48,0:08:04.32,GameMessage2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,200)\c&H62635F&\an5\fry15\fay0.23\fs34.5\blur0.75\frz356.8\pos(1060.71,340.425)}You can change the syntax in the following way.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.29,0:08:34.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks for waiting for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.97,0:08:38.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm tired.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.49,0:08:39.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tired and hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.13,0:08:43.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're starting to sound\Nlike an old man, Kirito.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.13,0:08:47.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, well, I feel like I've gotten\Nabout five years older in the last month.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.07,0:08:51.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And by the way, it's\Nnot Kirito, it's Kazuto.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.87,0:08:52.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is real life.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.17,0:08:55.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You shouldn't call someone\Nby their avatar's name here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.59,0:08:57.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, sorry, I forgot.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.47,0:08:59.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh no, now what am I gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.45,0:09:00.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone will know it's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.89,0:09:04.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's what you get for using\Nyour real name for your avatar.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.55,0:09:05.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Eh,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.46,0:09:06.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess it doesn't really matter,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.65,0:09:09.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,because everyone at our school\Nis stuck in SAO, same as us.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.67,0:09:11.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My cover's probably blown too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.19,0:09:17.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Asuna, are you getting around okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.77,0:09:20.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, is the rehab you're doing helping?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.31,0:09:21.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.22,0:09:23.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I finally got the okay to walk\Naround without my crutches.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.89,0:09:27.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Although, the doctors say I\Nshouldn't run just yet. You will.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.07,0:09:31.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By the way, Kirito... What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.93,0:09:36.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you know that everyone\Nin the cafeteria can see us?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.09,0:09:41.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.59,0:09:45.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That little oversight is\Ngoing to cost you lunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.49,0:09:46.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I didn't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.29,0:09:52.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Daddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.93,0:09:59.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was wondering about your dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.87,0:10:01.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is he okay? Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.43,0:10:04.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He is, but he's still not\Nover this whole thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.23,0:10:06.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He quit as CEO and took\Nan early retirement.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.13,0:10:10.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now that he's got all this free\Ntime, he doesn't know what to do with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.91,0:10:12.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hopefully Dad can find a hobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.59,0:10:14.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and maybe that'll cheer him up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.35,0:10:15.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope so.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.11,0:10:21.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That night in the parking lot,\Nthe police came and arrested Sugo.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.71,0:10:26.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Later, when they interrogated him,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.43,0:10:31.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he denied everything and tried to\Npin the blame on Akihiko Kayaba.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.35,0:10:34.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But after the police questioned\None of his employees,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.79,0:10:36.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sugo confessed to everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.73,0:10:40.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As for those 300 SAO players,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.73,0:10:44.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When they came to, they couldn't\Nremember anything about the experiments.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.17,0:10:48.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The good thing is they didn't suffer any\Nneurological or psychiatric after-effects,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.59,0:10:50.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so everyone can go back to their lives.
