Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.53,0:11:22.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know who I was just thinking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.75,0:11:23.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The commander.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.75,0:11:24.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What happened to him?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.23,0:11:27.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.33,0:11:29.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kayaba's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.45,0:11:30.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They say it was suicide.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.55,0:11:33.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.39,0:11:34.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When the world of SAO collapsed,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.93,0:11:38.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He did a high-output scan on his\Nbrain and fried it when it was over.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.75,0:11:39.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.66,0:11:42.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Was he trying to copy his\Nconsciousness to the net or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.85,0:11:47.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, it's one in a thousand shot for\Nit to work, but I know he pulled it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.11,0:11:49.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That day, Kayaba spoke to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.13,0:11:52.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or his consciousness did, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.89,0:11:55.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.80,0:11:57.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The beginnings of a new world.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.69,0:11:59.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I call it the seed.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.81,0:12:03.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once it sprouts, you'll know what it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.03,0:12:05.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What you do with it is up to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.89,0:12:07.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can even delete it if you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.55,0:12:09.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.46,0:12:13.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if you still have a tiny bit of\Nfondness left for the virtual world,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.09,0:12:14.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you'll take care of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.07,0:12:18.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kirito? Kirito?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.21,0:12:20.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't forget, we're\Nmeeting the others later.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.27,0:12:21.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.18,0:12:22.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.31,0:12:23.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry I was spacing out.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.67,0:12:24.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As always.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.75,0:12:27.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter whether\Nyou're in the game or IRL.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.57,0:12:30.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The minute you relax, you\Nspace out like a champ.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.23,0:12:34.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmph.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.95,0:12:44.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seriously, Lika, you're driving\Nme crazy with all that slurping.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.57,0:12:45.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Leave me alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.33,0:12:48.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's all over her, and\Nit's driving me nuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.53,0:12:52.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Acting like that at school, it's so tacky.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.35,0:12:56.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Spying on them's kind\Nof tacky too, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.59,0:12:57.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.87,0:12:59.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I'd have known it\Nwas gonna be like this,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.01,0:13:02.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't have let you talk\Nme into a mop-pong truce.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.41,0:13:04.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't talk you into\Nit, it was your idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.07,0:13:08.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You said we should let them have their\Nlil' romance for a month, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.57,0:13:10.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, God, talk about naive!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.65,0:13:18.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's gonna be cool meeting\Neveryone today, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.89,0:13:22.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I can't wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.73,0:13:35.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sugu, I forgot to ask before.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.85,0:13:36.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you ever meet Egil?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.97,0:13:37.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.88,0:13:40.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We went hunting together\Na couple of times in ALO.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.33,0:13:42.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His avatar is ginormous.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.27,0:13:45.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, well, get ready, because\Nhe's that big in real life, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.49,0:13:47.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Prepare to have your mind blown.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:51.78,0:13:53.29,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fs90\blur0.9\fnChinela Brush\c&H201630&\pos(960,358.5)}Booked
Dialogue: 1,0:13:51.78,0:13:53.29,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fs90\blur0.9\fnChinela Brush\c&H1E132D&\pos(1134,450)}For the
Dialogue: 1,0:13:51.78,0:13:53.29,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fs90\blur0.9\fnChinela Brush\c&H1D152E&\pos(1224,532.5)}Day!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.97,0:14:00.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.25,0:14:02.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Were we supposed to get here earlier?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.39,0:14:06.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We gave you a later time to make\Nsure everyone else got here first.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.85,0:14:10.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It wouldn't be right for the guests of\Nhonor to show up before all the guests.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.17,0:14:12.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't just stand there, come on in.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.13,0:14:12.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.29,0:14:15.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, let's get this party started.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.27,0:14:16.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You all know what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.53,0:14:18.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ready, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.44,0:14:21.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Congratulations on beating SAO, Kittito!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.01,0:14:27.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cheers!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.55,0:14:29.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cheers!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.46,0:14:30.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cheers!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.23,0:14:39.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bartender, bourbon on the rocks.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.07,0:14:45.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.09,0:14:47.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is Long tea.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.25,0:14:48.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.16,0:14:49.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Slide me a big boy drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.79,0:14:51.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Klein, seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.61,0:14:53.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aren't you supposed to go back to work?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.81,0:14:58.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alcohol makes the overtime go by faster.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.49,0:15:00.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh-oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.40,0:15:01.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chick alert.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.45,0:15:04.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Long time no see. Hi, Thinker.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.25,0:15:06.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How have you been?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.41,0:15:08.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I heard that you and\NYulia are married now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.11,0:15:11.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know it's late, but congrats.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.49,0:15:13.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.41,0:15:14.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But ever since we got back,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.75,0:15:17.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's been taking everything\Nwe've got to adjust to life here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.75,0:15:20.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The good thing is, I'm\Nsettling into work mode again.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.77,0:15:22.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Congratulations on getting that far.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.83,0:15:25.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, I've been reading the\Nnew MMO today. Nice job.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.93,0:15:27.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I wish it were better.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.83,0:15:30.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It could have used a bit\Nmore content. Oh, well.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.23,0:15:34.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With the way Miss are now, who\Nneeds walkthroughs and news?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.81,0:15:37.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those things are going to\Nbe irrelevant soon, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.17,0:15:39.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know what they say about\Nhow the universe was born.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.63,0:15:40.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,First there was chaos.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.41,0:15:44.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By the way, Egil, has\Nthe seed been doing okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.93,0:15:46.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's doing amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.67,0:15:49.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We got 50 mirrors already set up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.31,0:15:51.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's been downloaded 100 ,000 times.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.99,0:15:53.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And check this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.13,0:15:56.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's got 300 big-ass\Nservers actually running it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.13,0:15:59.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After I visited Asuna at the hospital,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.69,0:16:04.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I took the thing Kayaba called the Seed\Nover to Egil and asked him to check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.21,0:16:09.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Turned out it was a full-dive\NMMO that Kayaba developed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.41,0:16:12.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It came in a program package\Ncalled the World Seed,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.39,0:16:17.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a stripped-down version of the Cardinal\Nsystem that could run on small servers.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.79,0:16:20.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kayaba had modified the\Nprogram so that anyone
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.37,0:16:23.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,with access to an ordinary\Nserver could easily
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.25,0:16:27.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,download it and use it to create\Ntheir very own online world.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.51,0:16:29.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After Egiel said it was safe to use,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.89,0:16:31.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had him upload it to servers across the
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.77,0:16:34.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,globe so that everyone\Ncould access it for free.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.05,0:16:42.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It turned out that was exactly what virtual\NMiss needed to keep the genre going.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.57,0:16:44.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As for Alfheim Online,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.29,0:16:49.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,all the data was transferred to a new\Ncompany that decided to keep it online and
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.53,0:16:51.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,running.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.44,0:16:54.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But the new Alfheim wasn't the\Nonly world born out of the seed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.43,0:16:57.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone from individual\Ngamers to a few hundred small
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.33,0:17:01.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,companies were suddenly creating\Nbrand new worlds on their very
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.17,0:17:02.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,own virtual game servers.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.57,0:17:05.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The best part is they were\Nall connected to each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.87,0:17:09.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's almost to The point where you\Ncould create a character in one world,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.41,0:17:12.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then transfer it to another\Nwith all its skills intact.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.19,0:17:19.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, has anything changed for\Ntonight's after party? Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.09,0:17:20.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we're still on for 11.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.97,0:17:22.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we're meeting up in Yggdrasil City
