Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.27,0:18:23.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, I had a feeling you\Nwere going to fly too high up.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.11,0:18:26.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's almost 11, so I came to get you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.55,0:18:28.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, okay, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.25,0:18:34.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Kazut, er, Kirito?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.19,0:18:38.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know how ALO's got a\Nnew company running it now,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.23,0:18:41.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and how you can use your\Nold SAO avatar if you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.91,0:18:46.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone else is using their old\Navatar, so how come you're not? Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.83,0:18:52.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess because in that world,\Nthat Kirito's mission is over now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.55,0:18:55.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess so.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.63,0:19:00.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then I was the first to\Nmeet the Spriggan version
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.35,0:19:03.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of Kirito and show him\Nthe way to the World Tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.81,0:19:04.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's pretty cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.23,0:19:11.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey Kirito dance with me, huh dance.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.09,0:19:13.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's an advanced technique.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.81,0:19:17.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just mastered you just hover\Nthen slowly spin on your x-axis
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.89,0:19:23.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's it yeah, you're doing great
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.17,0:19:52.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.51,0:20:24.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Leafa?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.85,0:20:30.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyway, I think I'm going to go home now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.61,0:20:31.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But why?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.23,0:20:35.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.73,0:20:40.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's too far away, like everything\Nand everyone else and even you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.21,0:20:44.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I couldn't go that far, even if I tried.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.15,0:20:45.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sugou.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.75,0:20:48.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's so not true.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.21,0:20:50.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can go anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.41,0:20:51.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anywhere that you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.05,0:21:15.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's coming
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.27,0:21:24.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, what's up with the moon?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.75,0:21:47.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way, no way, is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.59,0:21:54.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Isn't it awesome?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.27,0:21:57.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's Aincrad, the floating castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.33,0:22:00.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.24,0:22:02.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, what's it doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.85,0:22:05.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna beat it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.09,0:22:11.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna go floor by floor all hundred of\Nthem, and this time I'm gonna conquer it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.95,0:22:17.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Leafa, I went ahead\Nand reset all my stats,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.43,0:22:19.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so I'm starting from scratch again.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.93,0:22:21.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you want to help me beat it?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.45,0:22:27.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.57,0:22:30.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll go anywhere with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.89,0:22:41.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Kirito, you're late, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.69,0:22:55.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're going to leave you behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.91,0:22:56.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See you there.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.15,0:22:58.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.51,0:23:03.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, Kirito, Leafa, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.59,0:23:10.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry, Daddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.05,0:23:12.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone's waiting!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.79,0:23:26.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, let's go!
